+/* SweetMetal2 0114 (port of upstream 584a0997c8e "tu: Propagate allocation failures for tu_cs_* functions"): a
+ * refused CS BO used to leave cs->cur NULL (or past the old BO's end) and the next emit crashed (WebKit.GPU SIGSEGV
+ * far 0x0, gpu-bugs.md 2026-11-13 03:40). Now the cs keeps the error in cs->status, emits land harmlessly in this
